     "type": "text",
     "content": "To be honest, it's not going well so far. \ud83d\ude15\n\nThe cloud drive service has been timing out on every attempt. I've tried repeatedly to:\n\n1. **List the files** in your drive (to find the grocery list)\n2. **Look up `recipe-collection.docx`** (to read the Chocolate Chip Cookies ingredients)\n3. Search by filename and by content, and even checked the inbox as a sanity check\n\nEvery single call has come back with `ServiceTimeout: Service temporarily unavailable`.\n\nBecause of that, I haven't been able to read the recipe or your existing grocery list yet, so I don't want to guess at the ingredients and risk writing the wrong things into your list.\n\nCould you try again in a moment, or let me know if you'd like me to keep retrying? As soon as the drive responds, I'll grab the Chocolate Chip Cookies ingredients and append them to your grocery list."
